# Cloudflare Pages 响应头配置（构建时由 public/ 平铺进 dist 根，Pages 自动生效）
# 注意：nosniff / X-Frame-Options / Referrer-Policy 已由 zone 级配置下发，这里不重复添加（避免双写重复头）。
# CSP 当前为 Report-Only（审计 H-01，第一步）：观察期结束、真实浏览器全流程无违规后，
# 把下方 Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only 改名为 Content-Security-Policy 切换强制，
# 并在策略末尾补回 upgrade-insecure-requests（该指令在 Report-Only 下被规范忽略，故暂不写入）。
/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://synchro-api.kkn.moe https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /
